# Prettier's scope in this repo is frontend sources under frontend/src/ — that is
# what `pnpm format:check` checks and what the pre-commit hook formats.
#
# Expressed as an allowlist rather than a denylist: a denylist silently grows
# stale, and an unscoped `prettier --write .` then reformats whatever was not
# listed yet. That is not hypothetical — it has re-expanded the minified
# docs/assets/logo.svg into a 300-line diff, and reached CI configs and the
# vendored conformance vectors under tests/, which must never be edited.
#
# The allowlist is a chain because an ignored directory is never descended into:
# `frontend/` has to be un-ignored before `frontend/src` can be.
/*
!/frontend
/frontend/*
!/frontend/src

# Within frontend/src/, generated and non-source paths stay out.
/frontend/src/**/*.snap
